The SVG font carries no version field. Version 2.000 is the name table version of the OTF-SVG and
CAD TTF builds in the same commit (fonts/open_otf-svg/ReliefSingleLineOTF-SVG-Regular.otf,
fonts/open_ttf/ReliefSingleLineCAD-Regular.ttf); the SVG font was built by FontForge on 14 February 2025.

relief-singleline.odsstroke.json is converted from the SVG font by tools/stroke_font, with the
family name "Relief SingleLine". It is a Modified Version under the OFL and keeps the same licence.
OFL.txt declares no Reserved Font Name, so the converted font may keep the name.
